{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765487,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Checkmate - Chess","festival_id":520986,"organization_id":1729197,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-15T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/checkmate-scaler-school-of-technology-1765487","region":"hybrid","details":"<p><strong>Checkmate &ndash; Chess<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Outthink. Outmaneuver. Outlast.<\/span><\/em><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Challenge your intellect, test your tactical sharpness, and outplay your opponents in an exhilarating tournament where rapid thinking and strategic mastery define every single move.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Put your skills to the test, face new opponents, and fight your way to the top in an intense <\/span><strong>5+3 blitz<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> format.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>Event Overview:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Stage 1:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Online Lichess Arena Qualifier<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Stage 2:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Offline 7-Round Swiss Tournament<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Time Control:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 5 minutes + 3 seconds increment (5+3)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Venue:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> College Cafeteria<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Tournament Structure:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Online Qualifier<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The first round will be conducted online on Lichess in an Arena format.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Finale &ndash; Offline Tournament&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The qualifiers will compete offline at the college cafeteria in an 8-round Swiss System tournament with a 5+3 time control. Final standings will determine the prize winners.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>Communication:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All important updates, schedules, and qualification details will be shared via the contact details provided during registration and on the Unstop event page. Participants are advised to check these platforms regularly.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Regulations:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Format:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Online Arena Qualifier followed by an Offline Final.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Governance:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Standard FIDE Laws of Chess and the Touch-Move rule apply.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Punctuality:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Players must report on time. Failing to take a seat within 2 minutes of the round start results in a forfeit.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Chess Clocks:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Only the approved Chess Clock App may be used on mobile phones. Phones must remain on Silent\/DND.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Illegal Moves:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 1st illegal move results in a 1-minute penalty to the opponent; 2nd illegal move results in a loss.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Fair Play:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Cheating, outside assistance, or unsportsmanlike conduct will result in immediate disqualification.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Tie-Breaks:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Buchholz system will be used as the primary tie-break criterion.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><strong>Arbiter Decisions:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The Chief Arbiter&rsquo;s decision is final.<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Disqualification Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cheating, use of external assistance, or unfair play.<\/li>\n<li>Providing false or incorrect registration details.<\/li>\n<li>Using a mobile phone or other device for purposes other than the approved chess clock during a game.<\/li>\n<li>Repeated rule violations or intentional illegal play.<\/li>\n<li>Unsportsmanlike, abusive, or disrespectful behaviour towards participants, arbiters, volunteers, or organizers.<\/li>\n<li>Failure to follow the Chief Arbiter&rsquo;s instructions.<\/li>\n<li>Late arrival beyond the permitted reporting time.<\/li>\n<li>Any attempt to manipulate game results or tournament standings.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Total Prize Pool: \u20b96,000<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>1st Place:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u20b93,000<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>2nd Place:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u20b92,000<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>3rd Place:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u20b91,000<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Required details during registration:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full Name<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phone Number<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lichess ID<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">College Name<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">College ID<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":"Total Prize Pool: \u20b96,000 - 1st: \u20b93,000 | 2nd: \u20b92,0